---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-50 via-white to-violet-50 py-24 px-4 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background decorative circles -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary/15 rounded-full -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/10 rounded-full translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <img src={`${base}images/logo.png`} alt="Conecta Litoral" class="h-24 w-auto mx-auto mb-6" />

    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight text-azul">
      Conectando ideas,<br class="hidden sm:block" /> <span class="text-primary">personas y territorios</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4 font-body">
      Emprendimiento, servicios y alojamientos del litoral, en un solo lugar y con el respaldo de la fundación.
    </p>

    <p class="text-base text-secondary font-medium mb-10 font-body">
      Juntos impulsamos tu negocio y fortalecemos nuestro litoral
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href="#publicar"
        class="bg-primary text-white font-heading font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-base hover:bg-azul transition shadow-lg"
      >
        Publica tu aviso
      </a>
      <a
        href="#guia"
        class="bg-white border-2 border-primary text-primary font-heading font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-base hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition"
      >
        Ver Guía del Litoral
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/56927698014"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="border-2 border-secondary text-secondary font-heading font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-base hover:bg-secondary hover:text-white transition"
      >
        Conversemos por WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
